SUMMARY:A Very FUNdraising Xmas
LOCATION:The Burren\, 247 Elm St\, Somerville\, MA 02144
DESCRIPTION:Boston’s ’90s band Fuzzy started a rock ’n’ roll Xmas t
 radition back in the early ’90s that has continued every year since. Mor
 e than 30 years later\, A Very FUNdraising Xmas remains one of Boston’s 
 most beloved holiday shows\, bringing together the city’s favorite rock 
 musicians for an unforgettable evening of holiday songs\, community\, and 
 cheer — all to benefit Rosie’s Place! Part concert\, part reunion\, an
 d all heart\, this annual celebration features live music\, raffles\, priz
 es\, giveaways\, and MCs Gene Dante\, Angelle Wood\, and Andrea Gillis. Th
 e all-star lineup includes Muck and the Mires // Merrie Amsterburg // Jen 
 Trynin // Magen Tracy // David & Stephen Fredette // Hilken and Melissa Ba
 nd // Chris Colbourn // The Handymen // Drew O’Doherty & Family // Other
  Girls // Thalia Zedek // Mike Gent\, plus members of Buffalo Tom\, Scruff
 y the Cat\, and more! Come celebrate over three decades of Boston’s favo
 rite rock ’n’ roll holiday tradition!\nhttps://tickets.24hourmusic.com
 /eventperformances.asp?evt=1939\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city
 /
URL:https://tickets.24hourmusic.com/eventperformances.asp?evt=1939
