SUMMARY:Damir Imamovic
LOCATION:Crystal Ballroom\, 55 Davis Square\, Somerville\, MA 02144
DESCRIPTION:Vivo Performing Arts presents Damir Imamovic Bosnian singer-son
 gwriter Damir Imamovic\, with his trio\, shares the narrative power\, the 
 gorgeous melancholy\, and the yearning inherent in sevdah music. Sometimes
  called 'Bosnian blues' or sevdalinka\, the music reflects Bosnia's rich c
 ultural history: Roma\, Slavic\, and Sephardic Jewish influences meld with
  sounds from across the Ottoman Empire. Imamovic\, a Sarajevo-born artist 
 with deep family roots in Balkan music\, preserves folk tradition while cr
 eating music that's evolving and vibrantly alive.\nhttps://www.ticketmaste
 r.com/damir-imamovic-somerville-massachusetts-02-18-2027/event/0100653BAEA
