DESCRIPTION:Avanza is a globally inspired band that is making a unique spla
 sh in the Boston music scene by introducing audiences to world musical sty
 lings and international cultural influences they could never find. Our app
 roach is to take contemporary pop and infuse it with traditional musical i
 nfluences from Spain\, Latin America\, and all over the world. We sing in 
 multiple languages\, including English\, Spanish\, Portuguese\, French\, A
 rabic\, Hindi\, and more! We do this so as many people as possible can see
  themselves represented and share in our music. Our goal is to make a chan
 ge in the Boston music scene by getting more people to fall in love with S
 panish\, Latin\, and world music and bring people of all backgrounds toget
 her to hear a part of their identity represented in a way that everyone wi
 ll love.\nhttps://tickets.24hourmusic.com/eventperformances.asp?evt=1937\n
